---
title: Checkout, one request
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant A as Auth
    participant O as Orders
    participant P as Payments
    U->>GW: POST /checkout
    GW->>A: verify token
    A-->>GW: ok
    GW->>O: create order
    O-)P: OrderCreated
    O-->>GW: 201 Created
    GW-->>U: 201 Created
